      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠺᠠᠯᠪᠠᠶᠢᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>kelbeyikü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>хэлбийх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>KELBEI-</transcript>
      <definition>v i. To lean or be inclined to one side; to list, careen; to deviate.</definition>
      <page>446</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠡᠷ ᠺᠠᠯᠪᠠᠶᠢᠵᠦ ᠪᠠᠶᠢᠮᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>ger --zy baimur</transcript>
          <definition>The yurt is tilted.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠠᠭᠤᠬᠤᠢ ᠳ᠋‍‍ᠤ‍ᠷ ᠺᠠᠯᠪᠠᠶᠢᠺᠦ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>saγuxui dur --ky ygei</transcript>
          <definition>To sit straight.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠦᠳᠡ ᠺᠠᠯᠪᠠᠶᠢᠵᠦ ᠪᠠᠶᠢᠮᠤᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>yde - -zy baimui</transcript>
          <definition>It is a little past noon!.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
